together a new NFS_ALL containing all the NFS client related stuff that
I plan on merging this week. See
  http://client.linux-nfs.org/Linux-2.6.x/2.6.22/
for details.

The git repository at git://git.linux-nfs.org/pub/linux/nfs-2.6.git has
also been rebased and updated with the same patchset.

